description.desc:
While under [Crimson Inscription], press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Unleash up to three Slashes forward with the blood axe, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
During the third attack, Anti-Interrupt level is increased. Hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to extend the skill duration.

While under [Crimson Inscription], after launching [Special Attack: Blood Blossom Oath - Jin Severance] or [EX Special Attack: Blood Blossom Oath - Blood Burial Onslaught] and successfully inflicting [Maim], Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Spins the blood axe downward and slashes the target enemy, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Sharpness is sufficient and not in [Crimson Inscription], press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Transforms the forging hammer into a blood axe and Slashes the target enemy, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
After consuming Sharpness to use this skill, enters [Crimson Inscription] for 16s. While off field, the duration no longer decreases;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

While in [Crimson Inscription], press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Performs a powerful upward Slash forward, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
During this skill, gains Immunity to attacks from enemies with [Gash];
If the attack hits an enemy with [Gash], inflicts [Maim] on the target, dealing additional <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Anti-Interrupt level is increased while using this skill.

While in [Crimson Inscription] and possessing [Personal Resources], during the [Special Attack: Execution] upswing, hold <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Launches a powerful continuous spinning Slash forward, dealing massive <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
If the attack hits an enemy with [Gash], inflicts [Maim] on the target, dealing additional <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Upon activating this skill, consume all [Personal Resources]. For every 1 point of [Personal Resources] consumed, the skill's DMG is increased by <color=#FFFFFF>6.5%</color>.
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Unleashes continuous Slashes on enemies ahead, dealing massive <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
When a heavy attack hits an enemy, directly applies 1 stack of [Gash] to the enemy;
During this skill, if already in <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Imprint]</color>, hold <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to quickly chain into [EX Special Attack: Blood Blossom Oath - Arcane Blood Forging] without consuming Sharpness, and extend [Crimson Imprint] duration by 4s;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When you or the on-field Character is about to be hit by a Control Skill attack, press <IconMap:Icon_Switch> to activate:
Engage in a struggle with the monster. Upon success, neutralize the enemy's Control Skill;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

desc:
All DMG dealt by Claret's skills is Sharp DMG, which uses DEF as the DMG Multiplier;
When a critical hit is triggered, Laceration DMG replaces CRIT DMG for calculation; when CRIT Rate exceeds 100%, an additional Laceration check is performed, with the Laceration probability equal to the excess CRIT Rate;
Sharp DMG accumulates Gash value. When the Gash value is full, the enemy enters [Gash], which can stack up to 3 times;
When Claret's [Special Attack: Blood Blossom Oath - Sever Steel] or [EX Special Attack: Blood Blossom Oath - Crimson Onslaught] hits an enemy in the [Gash] state, it consumes one stack of [Gash] and triggers [Maim] to deal additional DMG;
When the whole squad triggers [Maim], Claret gains 1 [Personal Resources];
After Claret enters [Crimson Engrave], her Anti-Interrupt level increases. When attacking targets with Blood Blossom Oath skills, CRIT Rate increases by <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>35%</color>, and DMG dealt increases by <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>25%</color>.

When another <color=#FFFFFF>[Stun]</color> Character or another <color=#FFFFFF>[Armorer]</color> Character is in the squad:
When a teammate's attack hits an enemy while they are the active Character, accumulates <color=#FFFFFF>3%</color> Gash value on the target. Can trigger at most once every 1s;
When a <color=#FFFFFF>[Stun]</color> Character in the squad hits an enemy with a [Special Attack] or [EX Special Attack] heavy attack while they are the active Character, triggers [Maim], once per use of a skill. Maim DMG is considered DMG dealt by Claret;
Whenever Claret or a teammate consumes 1 stack of [Gash] to trigger [Maim], enters [Gleaming Edge Unveiled]. While in the [Gleaming Edge Unveiled] state, PEN Ratio increases by <color=#FFFFFF>20%</color>, Daze dealt increases by 10%, lasting 10s;
After Claret enters the [Gleaming Edge Unveiled] state via [Maim], the first time she switches to a <color=#FFFFFF>[Stun]</color> or another <color=#FFFFFF>[Armorer]</color> teammate, extends [Gleaming Edge Unveiled] duration by 3s and copies this buff to the corresponding Character;
After a teammate triggers [Maim] and enters the [Gleaming Edge Unveiled] state, triggers Claret's Quick Assist: the first time she is switched in, she performs [Basic Attack: Blood Bloom Oath - Crouching Axe], extends [Gleaming Edge Unveiled] duration by 3s, and copies this buff to Claret;
Re-entering [Gleaming Edge Unveiled] via [Maim] extends the duration of [Gleaming Edge Unveiled].

